{"id":"vod_bf_33631","vodId":"33631","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"天降之物F","name_cn":"天降之物F","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-34/a87fa2e0599de2dc359d5e028c3ebf15.jpg"},"summary":"电视动画《天降之物f》改编自日本漫画家水无月嵩原作的漫画《天降之物》，亦是电视动画《天降之物》的第2期。《天降之物》故事以和平至上为座右铭的主角樱井智树为中心，他总是梦到一个想不起长相的女孩，直到有天从天而降了一位拥有白色翅膀的女性伊卡洛斯。自称是娱乐用万能天使的她，实际上却是拥有相当破坏力的战略兵器空之女王……在第1期的结尾，智树等人击退了刺客哈比后，回到和平的生活。而最近智树也开始习惯了有伊卡洛斯与宁芙在的热闹生活，原本以为不会再有什么大变化的日子中，智树却又再次梦到了之前看到的那个梦境，似乎又有什么事情将要发生……。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-17 15:15:51","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/tianjiangzhiwuF/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/tianjiangzhiwuF/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/tianjiangzhiwuF/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/tianjiangzhiwuF/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/tianjiangzhiwuF/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/tianjiangzhiwuF/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/tianjiangzhiwuF/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/tianjiangzhiwuF/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/tianjiangzhiwuF/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/tianjiangzhiwuF/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/tianjiangzhiwuF/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/tianjiangzhiwuF/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:43:11.641Z"}